      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "Warm selected route in the graphite rail.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-nav\" aria-current=\"page\">Today</button>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{font-family:'Inter Variable',sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:7px 11px;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap;transition:background-color .16s,border-color .16s,color .16s,transform .12s;justify-content:flex-start;padding:10px 13px;font-size:13px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 16%,var(--rail));color:var(--accent);border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 35%,var(--border))}.ds-nav:hover{background:#20242a}.ds-nav:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:3px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-nav{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Status Chip",
      "kind": "chip",
      "description": "Small status label in work rows.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-chip\">Suggested follow-ups</span>",
      "css": ".ds-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:3px 7px;background:#303640;color:#c7cfdb;font:500 10px 'Inter Variable',sans-serif;border-radius:4px;white-space:nowrap}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-chip{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Inline Note",
      "kind": "card",
      "description": "Flat information container without elevation.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-note\">Initial imported snapshots remain available while setup is pending.</div>",
      "css": ".ds-note{padding:12px 14px;margin:15px 0;background:#252b32;border:1px solid #3d4652;border-radius:6px;font:11px/1.7 'Inter Variable',sans-serif;color:#bec7d3}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-note{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Profile Trigger",
      "kind": "button",
      "description": "Full-width sidebar identity button, shown open.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-profile\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><span>S</span><div>Sanju<small>Personal + team workspace</small></div></button>",
      "css": ".ds-profile{font-family:'Inter Variable',sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:7px 11px;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap;transition:background-color .16s,border-color .16s,color .16s,transform .12s;width:100%;text-align:left;justify-content:flex-start;white-space:normal;padding:9px 5px;gap:9px;background:#282c33;border-color:#414853;color:var(--text);font-size:12px}.ds-profile>span{background:#343c47;border:1px solid #566171;width:31px;height:31px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center}.ds-profile>div{flex:1;min-width:0}.ds-profile small{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--muted)}.ds-profile:hover{background:#282c33;border-color:#414853}.ds-profile:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:3px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-profile{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}} .ds-profile:active:not(:disabled){transform:translateY(1px)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Account Menu",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Existing Radix account destination overlay.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-menu\" role=\"menu\" aria-label=\"Account\"><div class=\"ds-menu-label\">Sanju</div><div class=\"ds-menu-separator\" role=\"separator\"></div><div role=\"menuitem\" tabindex=\"0\">Profile &amp; account</div><div role=\"menuitem\" tabindex=\"-1\">Permissions &amp; privacy</div><div role=\"menuitem\" tabindex=\"-1\">App preferences</div><div role=\"menuitem\" tabindex=\"-1\">Connections &amp; integrations</div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-menu{min-width:235px;background:#242830;border:1px solid #535d6b;border-radius:9px;padding:7px;box-shadow:0 12px 32px #0007;color:var(--text);font:12px/1.5 'Inter Variable',sans-serif}.ds-menu [role=menuitem]{padding:10px 11px;border-radius:5px;outline:0;cursor:pointer}.ds-menu [role=menuitem]:hover,.ds-menu [role=menuitem]:focus-visible{background:#483526;color:#ffceaa}.ds-menu-label{color:var(--muted)}.ds-menu-separator{height:1px;background:var(--border);margin:4px 0}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-menu,.ds-menu-label,.ds-menu-separator{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}",
      "refersTo": "profile-menu"
    },
    {
      "name": "Media Tile",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "media-thumbnail",
      "description": "Thumbnail placeholder and filename hierarchy used by the media grid.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-media\"><button aria-label=\"Preview model\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"m12 3 8 4v10l-8 4-8-4V7Z M4 7l8 4 8-4 M12 11v10\"/></svg></button><strong>assembly.glb</strong><small>3D model \u00b7 local file</small></article>",
      "css": ".ds-media{max-width:220px;color:var(--text);font:12px/1.5 \"Inter Variable\",sans-serif;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding-bottom:16px}.ds-media button{display:grid;place-items:center;width:100%;height:135px;background:#20252c;color:var(--muted);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:11px;cursor:pointer}.ds-media button:hover{border-color:var(--accent)}.ds-media button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:3px}.ds-media small{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:7px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Project Completion",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Linked-task counts and completion meter; sample values demonstrate the component only.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-project\"><strong>Linked tasks completed</strong><div class=\"ds-meter\" role=\"meter\" aria-label=\"Example task completion\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"4\" aria-valuenow=\"2\"><span></span></div><small>2 Done / 4 linked \u00b7 example</small></section>",
      "css": ".ds-project{color:var(--text);font:12px/1.5 \"Inter Variable\",sans-serif;border-block:1px solid var(--border);padding:25px 0}.ds-meter{height:7px;background:#303641;border-radius:5px;overflow:hidden;margin:16px 0 22px}.ds-meter span{display:block;width:50%;height:100%;background:var(--ok);border-radius:5px;transition:width .5s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}.ds-project small{color:var(--muted);font-size:10px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-meter span{transition:none}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Evidence handoff",
    "overview": "GOTEET is a quiet, dense personal and team desktop. Graphite surfaces, pale text, compact Inter typography and a default apricot accent keep evidence, work records and deliberate actions easy to scan. The expanded system preserves the original identity while accommodating user-selected mint, blue and lavender accents.\n\nThe shared shell places navigation, the active workspace and an optional assistant side by side. Flat rows and tonal boundaries carry the hierarchy. Charts, measured gauges, media thumbnails and linked project summaries bring richer information into the same restrained visual language; motion marks navigation and state changes.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Graphite tonal layers and restrained accent selection states.",
      "Compact Inter typography, flat rows and visible source context.",
      "Data graphics derived from records, with readable legends and empty states.",
      "Media-led previews and familiar native desktop actions.",
      "Profile and preferences anchored to the sidebar identity."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Intentional Accent Rule",
        "body": "Use the selected accent for navigation, focus and deliberate actions; preserve distinct status colors and readable neutral context.",
        "section": "colors"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** preserve graphite surfaces, compact Inter hierarchy and the default apricot identity.",
      "**Do** honor the selected accent while retaining distinct status and chart meanings.",
      "**Do** pair graphics with counts, labels, coverage and real empty states.",
      "**Do** keep keyboard focus and OS/app reduced-motion behavior consistent.",
      "**Do** extend established rows, tabs, fields, previews and account controls."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** replace flat work rows with nested decorative cards.",
      "**Don't** copy illustrative preview content into evidence claims.",
      "**Don't** present source inspection or Mac captures as cross-platform visual validation.",
      "**Don't** use authentication or update setup gaps as evidence of visual defects."
    ]
  }
}
